## Acceptance Criteria

### Environments

| Environment | REST Base | WebSocket | Web3 RPC | Chain ID |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|----------|----------|
| Mainnet | `https://api.popdex.xyz` | `wss://ws.popdex.xyz/v1/ws/public` | `https://api.popdex.xyz/api/v1/web3/rpc` | 2184 |
| Testnet | `https://testnet-api.popdex.xyz` | `wss://testnet-ws.popdex.xyz/v1/ws/public` | `https://testnet-app.popdex.xyz/api/v1/web3/rpc` | 34952 |

### Credentials

- `popdex_perpetual_account_address` (main wallet / walletId)
- `popdex_perpetual_agent_private_key` (Agent Key only)
- Network selector (mainnet / testnet)
- Optional: sub-account index, builder address + fee rate

Main wallet private key must never be stored or used.

### Core Trading

- Place limit and market orders via Agent Key + Timestamp Nonce signed transactions to the Order contract
- Cancel and amend orders
- Support client order IDs (`clientOid`, max 32 chars, `[0-9a-zA-Z\-+_,#]`)
- Fetch pending orders, order details, history, and fills
- Handle receipts, failures, nonce desync, and batch operations
- Do not rely on `eth_call` / `eth_estimateGas` for EIP-712 simulation

### Account & Margin

- Account overview, balances, collateral, equity, available margin
- Sub-accounts / account index
- Position modes (`Oneway` / `Hedge`) and margin modes (`Cross` / `Isolated`)
- Leverage and position mode setting via UserConfig contract
- Account activation awareness (deposit required before trading)

### Perpetual Features

- Current + historical funding rates
- Position tracking, PnL, liquidation price, ADL rank
- Funding and liquidation history

### Market Data

- Symbols and trading rules
- Order book snapshots + updates
- Trades, tickers, candles, open interest

### WebSocket

Single public endpoint. Support public (order book, trades, tickers, candles, liquidations) and private channels keyed by `walletId` (orders, fills, positions, account, account config, trigger orders, funds transfer).

- Heartbeat: `"ping"` every 30s / `"pong"`
- Reconnection + REST reconciliation after disconnect

### Rate Limits

- Read: 1,200 weight / 60s per IP (`X-RateLimit-Weight-Used`)
- Write: wallet-based quota on target address (base 10k write + 10k cancel + volume, cap 500k)
- `eth_sendRawTransaction` = 10 weight
- Handle 429, `Retry-After`, and JSON-RPC errors `-32001` / `-32002`
- Use Hummingbot API Throttler

### Error Handling

- REST envelope: `{code, msg, data}`
- On-chain failures via receipt + failure lookup
- Historical data: 90-day max / 7-day query windows, cursor pagination

### Code Requirements

- Follow Perp Connector v2.1 checklist and QA checklist
- Single PR to Hummingbot `development` branch
- Pass CI and coverage
- Unit tests (REST, WS, signing, tx submission) + integration tests
- Documentation PR to hummingbot-site
- Comments on non-standard signing / on-chain logic
- HGP on Snapshot if required for official inclusion

### Additional Notes

- Testnet faucet available
- Recommended deposit path is Top-up Address (SIWE JWT)
- Builder fees optional (default to zero)
- Leverage / position mode changes require on-chain UserConfig transactions
- Accounts inactive until deposit is credited

